  "bodyHash": "75b3cb98047f7568",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">面向 Minecraft Forge 1.7.10 / 1.8.9 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keyboard-wizard\" rel=\"nofollow\">Keyboard Wizard</a> 移植版本。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">原版模组描述：</span></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">该模组有助于解决按键冲突并查找未绑定的按键。它添加了一个“额外”控制界面，在屏幕中央显示交互式键盘。</span></em></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">打开界面时（默认热键为 F8），左侧会显示按键绑定列表，右侧则是一个彩色键盘。</span></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>白色</strong>&nbsp;按键表示未绑定</span></em></li>\n<li><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>绿色</strong>&nbsp;按键仅有一个绑定</span></em></li>\n<li><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>红色</strong>&nbsp;按键有多个绑定</span></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">点击某个按键（或鼠标按键）可将列表中当前选中的绑定应用至该键。</span></em></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">点击“全部绑定”按钮可切换绑定列表中显示的类别。</span></em></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">您可以在下方的搜索栏中输入绑定名称来过滤列表。也可以通过在按键名称两侧添加尖括号进行过滤，例如 &lt;Left Control&gt;。</span></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>注意：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">您<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>绝对可以</strong></span>将该模组加入您的整合包中；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模组需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-keybinding\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>Modern Keybinding</strong></span></a> 作为依赖项（请注意，Modern Keybinding 可能也需要额外的依赖项）。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
